[APPENDIX] Rules on the Imposition of Anti-Dumping Duties on Poly(ethylene Terephthalate) Originating in China [Table]

Suppliers of Goods Subject to Duties and Anti-Dumping Duty Rates by Supplier (Related to Article 3)

Country of supply: China.

1. The following companies, their affiliates, and persons exporting their products: 7.00 percent.
  (a) Hainan Yisheng Petrochemical Co., Ltd.;
  (b) Yisheng Dahua Petrochemical Co., Ltd.;
  (c) Hainan Yisheng Trading Co., Ltd.;
  (d) Hainan Hengrong Trading Co., Ltd.
2. The following companies, their affiliates, and persons exporting their products: 7.98 percent.
  (a) China Resources Chemical Innovative Materials Co., Ltd.;
  (b) Zhuhai China Resources Chemical Innovative Materials Co., Ltd.;
  (c) China Resources Chemicals New Materials Co., Ltd.
3. Other suppliers: 7.98 percent.

Note: Where a supplier under subparagraph 3 has a special relationship under Article 23 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Customs Act with a supplier under subparagraph 1, the anti-dumping duty rate applicable to the related supplier under subparagraph 1 shall apply, notwithstanding the anti-dumping duty rate otherwise applicable to the supplier under subparagraph 3.
